    "body": "## Summary\n- add fail-closed unlocked-desktop Windows certification harness and self-hosted workflow\n- add ignored UIA/input/pointer/clipboard and WGC picker interactive tests\n- parse the PowerShell harness in hosted Windows CI without executing interactive claims\n- update Windows authority docs and release blockers to match merged native CI evidence\n\n## Claim discipline\nHosted Actions remain PASS_WINDOWS_NATIVE_CI only. The new workflow requires a self-hosted Windows runner labeled semwright-interactive. Unexecuted rows remain WINDOWS_INTERACTIVE_PENDING; external MCP filesystem mounts remain BLOCKED_PORTABLE_PATH_VIRTUALIZATION.\n\n## Local validation\n- cargo fmt --all -- --check\n- git diff --check\n- workflow YAML parse\n- release-readiness.json parse\n\nHeavy/native validation is delegated to GitHub Actions.",
